We may not decide to develop vonoprazan for additional indications and formulations beyond the ongoing EoE trial, or even if we proceed with such development, our efforts may not be successful or, if successful, may not result in increased revenues. We may expend our limited resources to pursue a particular indication or formulation for vonoprazan and fail to capitalize on product candidates, indications or formulations that may be more profitable or for which there is a greater likelihood of success;

